    "title": "怎么部署到cloudflare",
    "created_at": "2025-03-18T17:24:34Z",
    "closed_at": "2025-03-20T01:26:34Z",
    "labels": [
      "question"
    ],
    "url": "https://github.com/levywang/avhub/issues/14",
    "body": "怎么部署到cloudflare",
    "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/levywang/avhub/issues/14/comments",
    "author": "yimao009",
    "comments": [
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-19T06:24:37Z",
        "body": "仅有前端可以部署到cloudflare pages\n克隆仓库后修改 web/script.js 中的后端地址，cloudflare pages 配置根目录为 web"
      },
      {
        "user": "yimao009",
        "created_at": "2025-04-01T16:25:08Z",
        "body": "web/script.js 中的后端地址 是那个api地址吗 @levywang "
      },
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-04-01T16:28:49Z",
        "body": "```\nBASE_URL: '/app/v1',\n```\n\n是的。这一行，自建个后端地址，配置https证书后填写域名即可"
      }
    ]
  },
