    "number": 6,
    "title": "如何修改容器80端口",
    "created_at": "2025-03-13T15:23:17Z",
    "closed_at": "2025-03-13T15:57:02Z",
    "labels": [],
    "url": "https://github.com/levywang/avhub/issues/6",
    "body": "80，81被NPM占用",
    "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/levywang/avhub/issues/6/comments",
    "author": "Hansen1018",
    "comments": [
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-13T15:56:52Z",
        "body": "举例\n```bash\ndocker run -d -p 8080:80 -v $PWD:/app --name avhub levywang/avhub:latest \n``` \n"
      },
      {
        "user": "Hansen1018",
        "created_at": "2025-03-13T16:04:04Z",
        "body": "> 举例\n> \n> docker run -d -p 8080:80 -v $PWD:/app --name avhub levywang/avhub:latest\n\n是docker内部端口"
      },
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-14T01:23:42Z",
        "body": "你这个需求太小众，需要手动构建一个自己的镜像：\n克隆仓库后，修改`nginx.example.conf`中的端口为你自己想要的端口\n再修改`Dockerfile`中的`EXPOSE 80`端口，与上面的保持一致\n最后手动构建\n```bash\ndocker build -t <your_image_name> .\ndocker run ... <your_image_name>\n```\n"
      },
      {
        "user": "Hansen1018",
        "created_at": "2025-03-14T02:51:08Z",
        "body": "> 你这个需求太小众，需要手动构建一个自己的镜像： 克隆仓库后，修改`nginx.example.conf`中的端口为你自己想要的端口 再修改`Dockerfile`中的`EXPOSE 80`端口，与上面的保持一致 最后手动构建\n> \n> docker build -t <your_image_name> .\n> docker run ... <your_image_name>\n\n好的，感谢"
      }
    ]
  },
  {
    "number": 4,
    "title": "复制里番链接前端报错",
    "created_at": "2025-03-13T03:18:04Z",
    "closed_at": "2025-03-13T05:20:10Z",
    "labels": [
      "bug"
    ],
    "url": "https://github.com/levywang/avhub/issues/4",
    "body": "```\nscript.js:1332 Uncaught TypeError: Cannot read properties of undefined (reading 'writeText')\n    at copyToClipboard (script.js:1332:25)\n    at HTMLButtonElement.onclick ((index):187:2)\n```",
    "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/levywang/avhub/issues/4/comments",
    "author": "wensiwei",
    "comments": [
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-13T03:26:53Z",
        "body": "未能复现此现象，请尝试更换浏览器，可能是由于某些浏览器兼容性问题导致的"
      },
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-13T03:49:21Z",
        "body": "这个错误提示表明在调用 navigator.clipboard.writeText(text) 时，navigator.clipboard 是 undefined，导致无法读取 writeText 方法。\n​浏览器不支持 Clipboard API，主要原因是现在比较新的浏览器版本会认为这是不安全的，非https域名或者ip网站，会有这种错误，解决方法如下：\n1.给网站加上https协议\n2.手动复制\n\n后期我会进行优化，当无法复制时，直接在网页上显示链接地址"
      },
      {
        "user": "levywang",
        "created_at": "2025-03-13T05:20:10Z",
        "body": "已解决该问题，请拉取最新分支部署"
      }
    ]
  }
]